Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.91,0:00:48.28,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我停不下来 怪物转生 从零转生 豪赌一把
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.53,0:00:50.22,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}每次下注我都倾家荡产
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.37,0:00:51.27,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}但我根本不在意
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.29,0:00:51.92,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}反正都会赢回来
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.17,0:00:53.89,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}你看见了吗 那就享受吧
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.03,0:00:55.70,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}走在街上毛线帽戴好
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.82,0:00:56.87,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我可是从不厌战
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.91,0:00:58.69,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}谁叫我报酬总是拿双份
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.23,0:01:00.69,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}吃进去多少都是荣耀
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.83,0:01:02.44,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}最终像这样成为我血肉
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.65,0:01:05.34,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}囚禁我毫无意义 放我自由
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.59,0:01:08.03,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我不必无用的担心 baby
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.08,0:01:09.76,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我正在燃烧 yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.92,0:01:12.66,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}转生在这个舞台
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.86,0:01:14.91,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我们今夜定会横穿这城市
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.12,0:01:16.46,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}让我们开始吧
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.48,0:01:18.15,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)\(960,1065,960,1130,1570,1670)}{\t(500,550,\fscx125\fscy60)}沐浴烈焰
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.03,0:01:18.59,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\(960,1040,960,1065,1020,1120)\fad(50,100)}人生就像游戏
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.74,0:01:20.42,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}“绝对”只是假象
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.57,0:01:22.25,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}常识直接打碎
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.49,0:01:26.18,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)\(960,1065,960,1130,3590,3690)}{\t(2130,2180,\fscx125\fscy60)}我们浴火而生在当下
